<title>Venezuela and the Caribbean: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/venezuela/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-venezuela-2026-10-14T12:12:38.522Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:12:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan authorities have taken a fugitive businessman into US custody on bribery charges while President Maduro appears in court and a judge denied medical bail for Cilia Flores, prompting solidarity rallies. The United States arrested a soldier who allegedly earned $400,000 betting on Maduro's removal, and energy firms are recruiting former US officials to access Venezuelan oil as Eni and Repsol advance a FLNG project. Cuba’s grid collapse is worsening regional energy strain, and Starlink internet is now permitted to operate in Venezuela, expanding communications capability. 2 battle-related deaths in 2007 were recorded, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPZ1lFMnZBTXJ2UC1VZG96Mk1UMHZmS2JjWXBwZDFBME9HRC1tX0U2RC1wR2h2RGgzdlhYU3hwaXhnTVctclY5dDVPYU9NeWhCalgxWHNscEtmTW83a0IxSmZEdkdnOEk3UkstUVBzcWJGc1JmaGp3NGEtczRzYXJJWG1fY0NOQ25tSjFtM0tzY2xBY200Qlg2UFFvRk13NTdBSDZWTDZEeEhjbHlDdHA2VXVUUkNnNVFZbVFsenNMVldLRGJoMkYyaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPQjliTUxQVU5SSFc5MFBRd1hQZnJDTDV6b29xTmhpLVB4UHlEV0tuM1FKOE5HYW5BdmNUYTdGdGpEemxQYmJZcWFGMWp3eXFKOVJ6MnRRZ19DRGc3emloN0RWLWpyaFhnT0ljWDlEU0hTSU5LRUNjV0Y2WFIzWTJRdEpjR0Z4by1QVU56dzVuMVA2MUllTktyYzQ0ZnZqanFBRC0zSHJmc2V4eFZUdkxwRVh2UkxGT2JRcXpHX29UTjdUQTByREE?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOX0dPTzMxQmZlR2ROS0E2T3czWFg4ZVNHb1A3NG9fdmFsQzdhSG5YOTBMVHgxZzEyeTJpaWZYMHNuaW52WlZmNHItb1hmR2xha1ZtemVjSkw4U2psUzdNRVFGTmFUQXVJRmJudGVPMzFSRnFtSUhrQ1F3b3lvTERwVjI1VkkzUXZnaUo5U2Z3ZWRxNnl4S1ppRFJ6RlJ3WkZUNFpjZkM2OUw0NnV4MG5yUVQ1Zms0N25od1NySEZIUERMMjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxORzZIUm1ZM2hkWVlMRFM1eWRTSHVNeDho